+    max_turns: 100
+    estimated_wall_time_min: 90
+    model: opus
+    prompt: |
+      CONTEXT
+      The repo-wide Python suite is known to be red, and some tests can rewrite tracked result files. Exp6581 showed why this suite cannot be a model-launch precondition. V573 needs one honest low-cadence baseline in a disposable checkout. Test failures are scientific infrastructure evidence, not a task block. Work at {project_root}. The planning date is {date}.
